# 1. Cho phép commit TOÀN BỘ file trong experiments/results/ (json, csv, biểu đồ,...)
!experiments/results/
!experiments/results/**
# 2. Cho phép commit TOÀN BỘ file telemetry trong experiments/runs/ (raw jsonl)
!experiments/runs/
!experiments/runs/**
# 3. Cho phép commit TOÀN BỘ logs/ (worklog, notebook, và cả file server .log)
!logs/
!logs/**
!logs/*.log
!logs/**/*.log


